  ~ Maven POM Configuration for Apache Flink Stream Processing Application
  ~ 
  ~ This POM defines the build configuration for a production-ready Flink application
  ~ that processes shift opportunity events from Kinesis and outputs to OpenSearch.
  ~ 
  ~ Key Features:
  ~ - Flink 1.20.0 for latest stream processing capabilities
  ~ - AWS Kinesis connector for real-time data ingestion
  ~ - Custom OpenSearch sink with AWS IAM authentication
  ~ - S3 backup capabilities for disaster recovery
  ~ - Comprehensive logging and monitoring support
  ~ - Production-ready shade plugin configuration
